            default: qwen3-8-27b
            enum:
            - qwen3-8-27b
            enumNames:
            - Qwen 3.8 27B (NVFP4, 262K window, loop escalation)
            description: 'The model every worker of this run uses. Recorded once, in the

              destination''s initial commit (run-budget.json model); the

              migration-run provisioner pins that model''s profile in the run''s

              read-only run control, and dest-init generates the worker

              configuration from the pin (sampling, context, compression, and for

              Qwen 3.8 the loop escalation to a thinking turn). A model the

              platform''s profile table does not serve is refused at provisioning.

              A run never changes model.

              '
